:09:26Z","value":19,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5347720","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3833200-1847286114033661","game_id":"steam-3833200","kind":"announcement","title":"We extended the demo — thank you","summary":"It has been four days since Next Fest started, and honestly we did not expect this much interest. Far more people tried the game than we hoped, and a lot of you played the demo all the way to the end. Every piece of feedback and every bug report reached us — thank you. So many of you finished the demo and asked \"is there more?\" that we decided to extend it. With this update More of the map is playable, the demo now goes further The level cap is higher A new dungeon is open Just update the game a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:37:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033661","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3833200-1846651706691470","game_id":"steam-3833200","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is here and the Chest & Blade demo is live ⚔️","summary":"Hello everyone, and welcome! Our closed beta ended in September. Today the doors open to all of you: the Chest & Blade demo is live for Steam Next Fest. It's free on our Steam page and it stays up until October 26. If you were in the beta, thank you. If you're just finding us, you're right on time. What you'll play Pick Warrior, Mage or Barbarian and set out. Your hero fights on its own, and you're the one building it. Clear the stages, crack open chests, upgrade your gear. Lay out the skill tre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3833200-1842846814455988","game_id":"steam-3833200","kind":"announcement","title":"CLOSED BETA IS LIVE! ⚔️","summary":"Hello! The Chest & Blade Closed Beta has officially begun. The game we've been working on for so long is now being tested together with real players. If you'd like to experience Chest & Blade early and help shape its development, our doors are open. To play, just join our Discord server and ask for a beta key. Throughout the Closed Beta we're especially looking for your feedback on game balance, boss fights, items, dungeons, the loot system and overall progression. What you share will directly s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T15:15:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3833200-1841579228668578","game_id":"steam-3833200","kind":"announcement","title":"CHEST & BLADE CLOSED BETA IS STARTING! ⚔️","summary":"Hello!After a long stretch of work, we're finally opening the doors of Chest & Blade to players.Three big steps ahead of us: Closed Beta → Demo → Full ReleaseAnd we're taking the first one in the last week of August — that's next week.Why a Closed Beta?We want Chest & Blade shaped by what real players go through, not just by our own testing. Where a game slows down, which boss hits too hard, which reward doesn't land the way it should — nobody shows that better than someone playing it for the fi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T12:28:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228668578","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_